---
manual: slot.show
lines: [2465, 2468]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  @box = stack width: 100, height: 100, hidden: true do
    background red
  end
end
----------- test code
refute_equal [255, 0, 0, 255], pixel_at(50, 50), "hidden to begin with"

stack("@box").show

assert_equal [255, 0, 0, 255], pixel_at(50, 50), "show reveals the slot"
